    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a mix of fascination and frustration for me. I appreciate its logical structure and how it underpins so many fields, especially computer science and economics—my favorite subjects. However, I sometimes struggle with abstract concepts, which can be both challenging and rewarding. It’s a subject that demands patience but offers deep satisfaction when problems are solved.",
